%% CURRENT prod,remote diagram; UC02 商家发现、详情与收藏; services: merchant-service
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as frontend
    participant B as backend BFF
    participant M as merchant-service
    participant D as merchant DB
    U->>UI: 搜索、查看详情或收藏
    UI->>B: /api/v1/categories、/merchants、/user/favorites
    B->>M: internal HTTP + service token
    M->>D: 查询目录/详情/收藏及评价投影
    D-->>M: 自有数据与只读投影
    M-->>B: 结果或受控错误
    B-->>UI: 稳定公开响应信封
    UI-->>U: 列表、详情或收藏状态
